      "Outlines parallel, sequential, and hybrid review workflows.",
      "Explains context sharing between specialized review agents.",
      "Shows how to synthesize agent findings into a prioritized report.",
      "Covers security, architecture, performance, compliance, and deployment review roles."
    ],
    "limitations": [
