        "prompt": "Given this project summary: [summary], choose review agents and explain why each one is needed.",
        "scenario": "Agent selection"
      },
      {
        "title": "Synthesize Findings",
        "prompt": "Combine these agent findings into one prioritized review report: [paste findings]. Resolve conflicts and list next actions.",
        "scenario": "Intermediate synthesis"
      },
      {
        "title": "Design a Hybrid Workflow",
