          "Final report should prioritize issues by user impact and exploitability."
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": "Three agents disagree about a caching change.",
        "output": "The skill compares evidence, confidence, user impact, and reversibility before proposing a final recommendation."
      },
      {
        "input": "A regression affects latency and error rates.",
        "output": [
          "Recommended agents: performance analyst, code quality reviewer, and architecture reviewer.",
          "Synthesis should separate immediate rollback options from longer-term design fixes."
